        "title": "introduced noun base + 子",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "子 is an unstressed noun suffix in learned words such as 桌子 and 椅子. It does not contribute child and cannot be added to every noun.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这是桌子。",
                "pinyin": "zhè shì zhuōzi 。",
                "meaning": "This is a table.",
